    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Extraordinary Irish vacation home which offers discerning guests the most scenic settings on Ireland's west coast. \r\n\r\nYou can't but be impressed when staying at this superb Westport holiday home; Croagh Patrick is literally in your back garden and even more impressive, are the captivating views of Clew Bay from nearly every window.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nSurrounded by mature gardens and outdoor patios with BBQ facilities, the generous accommodation features include a country style chef's kitchen diner, a sunroom and an extra spacious utility & laundry room.\r\n\r\nFirst-floor accommodation offers five spacious double bedrooms with a combination of king, double and twin rooms. There is also a family suite with two bedrooms.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nA supremely dreamy location on the Wild Atlantic Way right at the foot of Croagh Patrick overlooking Clew Bay & Bertra Beach. Within 5 miles of Westport town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "At the foot of Croagh Patrick\r\nStunning views of Clew Bay\r\nWithin 5 miles of Westport town\r\nMature gardens with patios & BBQ"
      }
    ],
